"电视已报告停止播放。确认画面和声音都停了，再点下面允许继续。" = "The TV reports that playback stopped. Check that both picture and sound stopped, then allow viewing below.";
"允许继续播放" = "Allow viewing";
"暂停指令已发出，正在等电视确认。请看电视是否显示休息页面。" = "Pause sent. Waiting for the TV to confirm. Check whether its break screen appears.";
