"在电视设置里关闭 ADB／USB／网络调试。找不到开关时，请让电脑助手带着你操作。手机留在此页。" = "Turn off ADB, USB or network debugging in the TV settings. Ask your computer assistant for the exact steps if needed. Stay on this phone page.";
"已关闭，检查一下" = "It’s off — check";
"在电视系统菜单里选择“重启”，不要只按电源键。等电视回到桌面，再点下面检查。" = "Choose Restart in the TV’s system menu, rather than just pressing Power. When its home screen returns, tap the check below.";
"电视已重启，检查连接" = "TV restarted — check";
"需要离开时，可从“我的 → 家庭设备”回来继续。不要重新生成安装码或移除电视。" = "If you leave, return through My Family → Family devices to continue. You do not need a new code or to remove the TV.";
"请先登录家庭。" = "Sign in to your family first.";
"先让电脑助手完成安装。它说电视已连接后，点“检查电视连接”。" = "Let your computer assistant finish setup. When it says the TV is connected, tap Check TV connection.";
"请截下这一页，发到电脑助手的聊天里，让它检查权限。切换页面不会取消安装。" = "Take a screenshot of this page and send it to your computer assistant’s chat to check access. Switching pages will not cancel setup.";
"视频已停止，电视可能显示休息页。确认没有视频声音后，点“允许继续播放”。" = "The video has stopped; the TV may show a break screen. Check that video sound has stopped, then tap Allow viewing.";
"正在等电视停止，通常十来秒。超过45秒仍未停，请把这一页截图发给电脑助手。" = "Waiting for the TV to stop, usually around ten seconds. If it has not stopped after 45 seconds, send a screenshot of this page to your computer assistant.";
"已解除暂停，但今天的观看时间已用完。请让电脑助手先确认测试安排。" = "Pause is off, but today’s viewing time has run out. Ask your computer assistant to check the test plan before continuing.";
"已解除暂停，但现在仍是休息时间或还有其他限制。请让电脑助手先确认测试安排。" = "Pause is off, but a break time or another limit still applies. Ask your computer assistant to check the test plan before continuing.";
"重新检查观看状态" = "Check viewing status again";
"休息页关闭后，请用电视遥控器重新播放视频。有视频画面和声音后，点“视频已播放，检查结果”。" = "When the break screen closes, use the TV remote to play the video again. Once video and sound return, tap Video is playing — check.";
"按电脑助手给出的电视菜单路径，关闭它指出的调试开关。只操作那个开关；关好后，点“已关闭，检查一下”。" = "Follow your computer assistant’s TV menu instructions and turn off the debugging switch it names. Change only that switch, then tap It’s off — check.";
"在电视系统菜单里选择“重启”。回到电视桌面后，点“电视已重启，检查连接”。找不到重启入口时，请让电脑助手指路。" = "Choose Restart in the TV’s system menu. When the home screen returns, tap TV restarted — check. Ask your computer assistant if you cannot find Restart.";
"离开不会取消安装。回来时点底部“我的”→“家庭设备”里的这台电视→“继续安装”。" = "Leaving will not cancel setup. To return, tap My family at the bottom → your TV under Family TVs → Continue setup.";
"先完成当前检查" = "Finish the current check";

// TV sharing, setup and connection guidance.
"在家更快，在外也能用" = "Faster at home, available when you're away";
"手机和电视连着同一个家用 Wi-Fi 时，可以直接沟通。在外面用手机流量时，就通过你选择的服务器联系电视。App 会自动选择，你不用手动切换。" = "When your phone and TV are on the same home Wi-Fi, they can connect directly. When you're away using mobile data, your chosen server connects them. The app chooses the route automatically; you don't need to switch it.";
"这台电视的直连状态" = "Direct connection for this TV";
"已直接连接电视" = "Connected directly to the TV";
"已配对，等待在家连接" = "Paired, waiting to connect at home";
"还没有开启直连" = "Direct connection isn't enabled yet";
"电视当前反馈" = "Latest response from the TV";
"重新连接这部手机" = "Reconnect this phone";
"开启这部手机的直连" = "Enable direct connection on this phone";
"正在连接…" = "Connecting…";
"首次开启时，手机和电视都需要联网，并允许本地网络访问。配对有效期最长30天；过期后重新连接即可。" = "For first-time setup, both your phone and TV need internet access, and the app needs Local Network permission. Pairing lasts up to 30 days. Reconnect when it expires.";
"在家：直接发给电视" = "At home: send directly to the TV";
"暂停、允许观看和规则调整先直接送到电视，通常更快。已完成配对后，外网暂时断开也能使用有效的直连授权。" = "Pauses, permission to watch and rule changes go directly to the TV first, which is usually faster. Once paired, you can keep using a valid direct connection even if internet access is temporarily lost.";
"同一个 Wi-Fi 名称也可能有设备隔离。如果找不到电视，先确认不是访客网络，或让安装助手检查。" = "Devices may be blocked from reaching each other even on Wi-Fi with the same name. If the TV isn't found, check that you're not using a guest network, or ask your setup assistant to help.";
"在外：通过服务器联系" = "Away from home: connect through the server";
"手机不在家，或没有直接连到电视时，操作会经过官方或自部署服务器。电视需要保持联网，可能会多等几秒。" = "When your phone is away or can't connect directly, controls go through the official or self-hosted server. The TV needs to stay online, and it may take a few extra seconds.";
"直连不代表数据只留在家里。账号、设置和观看记录仍会按你选择的服务同步；直连只是让操作更快送达。" = "Direct connection doesn't keep all data inside your home. Your account, settings and viewing history still sync with your chosen service. It just helps controls reach the TV faster.";
"用了什么技术？" = "How does it work?";
"App 通过 Bonjour（mDNS）发现同一网络里的电视，使用 TLS 加密连接并校验电视身份。每条操作带有这部手机的数字签名，电视确认授权后才执行。" = "The app uses Bonjour (mDNS) to find TVs on the same network. It encrypts the connection with TLS and verifies the TV's identity. Each command is digitally signed by this phone, and the TV checks authorization before applying it.";
"只有你配对过的这部手机能使用该授权。断网期间，电视可能还不知道你已在服务器撤销授权；重新联网后会再次核对。" = "Only the phone you paired can use that authorization. While offline, the TV may not know you've revoked it on the server. It checks again when it reconnects.";
"手机只在 App 打开时寻找电视，不会一直在后台扫描。拒绝本地网络权限后，仍可通过服务器操作。" = "Your phone looks for the TV only while this app is open, rather than scanning continuously in the background. If you deny Local Network access, you can still use server controls.";
"关闭后，这部手机仍能通过服务器操作电视。其他手机不受影响。" = "This phone can still control the TV through the server. Other phones aren't affected.";
