// History retention and independent access sources.
"观看汇总默认保留最近180天，与是否订阅无关；免费账号只可查看当天，订阅或维护者授权可查看历史。超出180天的数据会在每日清理时移除。可在“我的”中删除家庭与云端数据；退出登录只清除本机登录凭证。独立测试服务的数据请联系运营者处理。" = "Viewing summaries are kept for the last 180 days by default, whether or not you subscribe. Without a subscription or access granted by the service operator, you can view today only. Either can unlock history. Data older than 180 days is removed during daily cleanup. Delete your family account and cloud data in My family. Signing out clears only the account data saved on this phone. For self-hosted services, contact the operator about data handling.";
"订阅与历史权限" = "Subscription and history access";
"Apple 订阅" = "Apple subscription";
"未订阅" = "Not subscribed";
"历史查看" = "History access";
"维护者已授权" = "Access granted by service operator";
"订阅已授权" = "Access through subscription";
"仅当天" = "Today only";
"维护者权限允许查看历史，不代表已购买 Apple 订阅。你仍可正常测试购买与恢复。" = "Access granted by the service operator lets you view history. It doesn't mean you have an Apple subscription. You can still purchase or restore one.";
"查看订阅" = "View subscription";
"查看最近 180 天观看趋势" = "See viewing trends for the last 180 days";
"月度自动续订。付款由 Apple 收取，续订价格以购买确认页为准；可随时在 Apple 订阅设置中取消，取消后可用至当前周期结束。观看汇总默认保留180天；订阅开放历史查看，到期后仅可查看当天，维护者授权独立生效。设备连接和基础控制可免费使用。" = "Renews monthly. Apple handles payment; the renewal price appears on the purchase confirmation screen. Cancel at any time in your Apple subscription settings and keep access until the current period ends. Viewing summaries are kept for 180 days by default, and a subscription unlocks history. After it expires, you can view today only unless the service operator has separately granted history access. TV connections and basic controls are free.";
