"这些设置从哪里来" = "Where these settings come from";
"世界卫生组织建议：1岁儿童不安排久坐屏幕时间；2至4岁每天不超过1小时，越少越好。" = "The World Health Organization recommends no sedentary screen time for 1-year-olds. For ages 2–4, it recommends no more than one hour a day; less is better.";
"阅读 WHO 幼儿活动与屏幕时间指南" = "Read the WHO guidelines on activity and screen time for young children";
"美国儿科学会的幼儿媒体建议强调：18个月以下避免使用屏幕（视频通话除外）；18至24个月如开始接触，应选择优质内容并由家长陪同。" = "The American Academy of Pediatrics recommends avoiding screens before 18 months, except for video calls. For ages 18–24 months, if media is introduced, choose high-quality content and watch together with a parent.";
"阅读 AAP 幼儿媒体使用建议（2016）" = "Read the AAP guidance on young children and media (2016)";
"澳大利亚卫生部门建议：5至17岁每天的久坐娱乐屏幕时间不超过2小时。" = "Australian health authorities recommend no more than two hours of sedentary recreational screen time a day for ages 5–17.";
"阅读澳大利亚儿童与青少年活动指南" = "Read the Australian activity guidelines for children and young people";
"18至24个月每天30分钟、每次15分钟和至少休息5分钟是本产品的可选预设，并非上述机构共同规定的标准。预设额度不是建议看满的时间。请把手机、平板等其他屏幕时间也算进去，优先保证睡眠、活动和家人陪伴。" = "The 30-minute daily limit for ages 18–24 months, 15-minute sessions and breaks of at least five minutes are optional product presets, not a shared standard set by these organizations. Preset limits aren't targets to fill. Count time on phones, tablets and other screens too, and prioritize sleep, activity and time together as a family.";
