// TV update transfer and on-TV installation confirmation.
"最新发布版本" = "Latest released version";
"这台电视尚未支持手机升级，需要先通过电脑安装一次带有升级功能的客户端。之后可在同一 Wi-Fi 下从这里发起更新。" = "This TV doesn't support updates from your phone yet. First use a computer to install a companion app with update support. After that, you can start updates here while both devices are on the same Wi-Fi.";
"打开安装引导" = "Open setup guide";
"电视已是最新发布版本" = "The TV is on the latest released version";
"手机先下载并校验安装包，再通过加密直连传给电视。最后请用遥控器确认安装；绑定和观看记录会保留。" = "Connect your phone and TV to the same Wi-Fi. Your phone downloads and verifies the update package, then sends it to the TV over an encrypted direct connection. Use the TV remote to confirm installation. The TV's link to your family account and its viewing records will be kept.";
"开启局域网直连" = "Enable home network connection";
"下载并传送更新" = "Download and send update";
"检查升级结果" = "Check update status";
"如果电视提示不允许安装，请进入电视显示的权限页面，允许“电视时间”安装应用，然后返回确认。部分电视会限制此权限；此时请使用电脑安装引导。更新过程可能暂时中断观看。" = "If the TV blocks installation, open the permission screen it shows and allow the TV companion app to install apps. Then return to confirm installation. Some TVs restrict this permission; use the computer setup guide if that happens. Updating may briefly interrupt viewing.";
